{"id":6703,"path":"/anime/6703-flag","updatedAt":"2026-10-28T15:15:15.332Z","info":{"title":"Flag","synopsis":"Una guerra civile devasta un piccolo paese in Asia e, nonostante l'invio di truppe da parte delle Nazioni Unite, la pace appare come una lontana chimera. All'improvviso, però, accade una specie di miracolo: una foto scattata accidentalmente sul campo di battaglia, avrà il potere di riaccendere il desiderio di pace. Essa immortala una scena in cui dei gruppi soldati appartenenti ad opposte fazioni collaborano per innalzare una bandiera su un santuario. Da quel momento quella bandiera si trasforma nel simbolo della pace; e proprio per questo essa verrà trafugata da un gruppo di estremisti contrari ad ogni tipo di accordo con l'avversario.","image":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0874001/img","poster":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/season/30949/posters/60a0519b5823b.jpg","logo":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt0874001/img","background":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0874001/img","imdbId":"tt0874001","type":"series","tags":["ONA","Terminato","Estate","2006"],"tagKeys":{"ONA":"ONA","Terminato":"Completed","Estate":"Summer"},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Mecha","Military"],"rating":"7.5","studio":"The Answer Studio","episodesCount":13,"extra":{"ids":{"malId":1299,"anilistId":1299,"crunchyId":null,"disneyId":null,"netflixId":null,"primeId":null,"anilistIds":[1299],"malIds":[1299],"anidbIds":[4476],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[45047],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[79474]},"stats":{"scoreRaw":"7.50","favorites":14,"members":61,"views":3865,"episodesCountRaw":13,"episodesLength":24},"flags":{"dub":0,"alwaysHome":0},"meta":{"day":"Indeterminato","season":"Estate","status":"Terminato","type":"ONA","createdAt":"2025-06-17 19:58:06","userId":2},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1299","mal:1299"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-13":"1-13"}}]},"artworkSources":{"logo":"cinemeta","poster":"tvdb","background":"cinemeta"},"artworkCandidates":{"logo":[{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt0874001/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/79474/clearlogo/611dbd863cc44.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/79474-4.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx1299-Zz8fUhhwDQDd.png"},{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/poster/small/tt0874001/img"}],"background":[{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://live.metahub.space/background/medium/tt0874001/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/fanart/original/79474-1.jpg"},{"source":"provider","url":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/1299-41FpA7NwaTPW.jpg"}]}},"related":[],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-13","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":13},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"6703|1|13"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Flag","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"98055","synopsis":"An armed extremist faction had stolen the FLAG, which was previously seen as the symbol of peace that triggered the cease-fire initiative between armed factions and the government forces in Uddiyana. The UN secretly dispatched a SDAC unit to retrieve the FLAG. Saeko Shirasu was assigned as the accompanying reporter. \r\n\r\nAlternate Synopsis:\r\nIn the mountainous Asian country of Uddiyana a civil war rages. No end lies in sight for the war-torn nation until a lone photographer snaps an iconic image that comes to be known simply as \"Flag.\" Hope arises as the many factions involved begin an approach to peace, rousing the call for a ceasefire behind the featured flag.\r\n\r\n \r\nWhen an unknown guerilla sect steals this symbol of unity, a U.N. Special Development Command unit is dispatched using the latest in military technology, a transforming bipedal exoskeleton known as the HAVWC system. Recruited to document this mission is a war-time journalist, the author of the \"Flag\" photograph, Saeko Shirasu. Witness the trials and triumphs of a peacekeeping taskforce behind the camera's view-finder as they take their first steps towards the recovery of the road to peace and discover the truth behind a struggle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354602.jpg"},{"title":"Portrait","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"98056","synopsis":"Saeko started her reporting inside the SDAC secret base. However, Captain Chris denied Saeko's request to follow any military operations involving the use of HAVWC. Saeko tried to capture the soldiers in camera as they returned to base.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354603.jpg"},{"title":"Embedded Journalist","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"98057","synopsis":"The SDAC unit is planning scouting missions in area where the FLAG was believed to be hidden. Once again Saeko's request to accompany the unit was denied. Nadi Olowokandi offered his helping hand.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354604.jpg"},{"title":"Night of the New Moon","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"98058","synopsis":"It was established that the defence capabilities of the armed faction base was much stronger than expected. The SDAC unit decided to launch an operation to retrieve the flag on the night of the new moon. Preparation of the HAVWC tanks, the key element of the operation, became a race against time, and Saeko spent over night covering the activities of the unit. Meanwhile on the same night, as reporter Akagi was pursuing a young girl, a reincarnate of the goddess Kuhura.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354605.jpg"},{"title":"Hyperbolic Curves in the Nights","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"98059","synopsis":"On the night of the new moon, the SDAC unit began its campaign to retrieve the flag and was heading towards the \"Ruins\", the armed faction stronghold. Shirasu witnessed the crossfire while accompanying the unit. At the same time, the journalists, suspicious of the UN forces, found out about the UN's plan to bomb the city. Akagi had some idea where the target of bombing would be.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354606.jpg"},{"title":"Light in the Darkness","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"79474","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"98061","synopsis":"Ichiyanagi stormed in the armed faction stronghold to retrieve the FLAG. As the team were following the IC tag signal, something unexpected was waiting for them. They discovered the conspiracy to hinder the ceasefire. Facing return attack from the enemy and with no where to retreat, he attempted to breakthrough.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79474/354607.jpg"},{"title":"Reactivation","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"4476","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1299","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45047",